            "Complete the cleaning, processing, drying, storage and traceability plan before expanding the fleet. More scopes will not solve an unfunded processing bottleneck, and a donated reprocessor does not establish compatibility. STERIS prohibits processing devices excluded by their manufacturer or absent from its compatibility finder. An existing supported SYSTEM 1E installation can therefore favor particular compatible scopes; an unsupported or mismatched machine can add cost without adding usable capacity.",
